msgid ""
"Shared HMAC-SHA256 secret (>= 32 chars) the MTIL Flask API signs per-user tickets with; MUST equal the harness DSH_TICKET_SECRET. The Flask API reads it from this parameter. Never exposed to the browser."
msgstr ""
